      "sourceTextSha256": "b55427ac80e0bf217d45edd8ecb771cdbea33395786f3ea00e3d89cbb99ab021",
      "text": "The visit to see the penguins at Puñihuil is weather permitting. The day’s route in Torres del Paine also depends on the weather.",
